{"s":"SO","updated":"2026-11-07T04:21:13.231326+00:00","profile":{"name":"The Southern Company","summary":"The Southern Company, through its subsidiaries, engages in the sale of electricity. The company offers electric service to retail customers and wholesale customers; and energy-related products and services to natural gas choice markets. It also develops, constructs, acquires, owns, operates, and manages power generation assets, as well as battery energy storage projects; sells electricity at market-based rates in the wholesale market; and deploys microgrids for commercial, industrial, governmental, and utility customers. In addition, the company is involved in the distribution of natural gas in Illinois, Georgia, Virginia, and Tennessee; distributes energy and resilience solutions; and invests in telecommunications. The Southern Company was incorporated in 1945 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","sector":"Utilities","employees":29502,"address":"30 Ivan Allen Jr. Boulevard, NW, Atlanta, GA 30308, United States","phone":"404 506 5000","website":"https://www.southerncompany.com","ir":"http://investor.southerncompany.com/","exchange":"NYSE","officers":[{"n":"Mr. Christopher C. Womack","t":"CEO, President & Chairman","age":67,"pay":5431992},{"n":"Mr. David P. Poroch","t":"Executive VP & CFO","age":55,"pay":1599434},{"n":"Mr. Stanley W. Connally Jr.","t":"Executive VP & COO","age":56,"pay":2327228},{"n":"Mr. Daniel S. Tucker","t":"Senior Advisor","age":55,"pay":2442857},{"n":"Ms. Kimberly Scheibe Greene","t":"Chairman, President & CEO of Georgia Power","age":59,"pay":2873203},{"n":"Mr. J. Jeffrey Peoples","t":"Chairman, President & CEO of Alabama Power Company","age":65,"pay":2460797},{"n":"Mr. Matthew M. Kim","t":"SVP, Comptroller & Chief Accounting Officer"},{"n":"Mr. Greg MacLeod","t":"Director of Investor Relations"},{"n":"Mr. Sterling A. Spainhour Jr., J.D.","t":"Executive VP & Chief Legal Officer","age":56},{"